WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.960
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:37.480 --> 01:39.320
The Ceremony
finally ended without a hitch.

01:39.400 --> 01:41.200
You've worked hard these days,
Deputy Director Xiao.

01:41.720 --> 01:44.200
Let's enjoy tonight's Grand Festival.

01:47.080 --> 01:47.920
Not yet.

01:50.680 --> 01:52.440
The Grand Festival is the main event.

02:07.560 --> 02:08.880
You're here early.

02:08.960 --> 02:11.160
For tonight's Grand Festival,
is everything in place?

02:12.440 --> 02:13.560
Look.

02:13.640 --> 02:16.600
Am I going to be your horse keeper
or your household servant?

02:17.200 --> 02:19.800
The last time I entered
the palace was 20 years ago.

02:21.160 --> 02:22.000
What's your plan?

02:23.240 --> 02:26.560
Just get me into the palace
and keep me out of sight.

02:26.640 --> 02:28.520
I'll handle everything else.

02:29.480 --> 02:30.720
Don't worry.

02:31.240 --> 02:32.080
I give you my word.

02:32.680 --> 02:33.560
This time,

02:34.080 --> 02:35.720
I'll avenge the Prince of Duan.

02:36.360 --> 02:37.800
You trust him that much?

02:39.360 --> 02:40.640
It's already past Shen Hour.

02:41.240 --> 02:44.480
Go rest a bit. We'll be busy again soon.

02:58.360 --> 02:59.440
Just as I thought.

03:00.040 --> 03:01.120
So you're here too, Mr. Xiao.

03:01.640 --> 03:03.200
You already knew
the Celestial Lord was him.

03:03.280 --> 03:04.440
Why hide it?

03:05.040 --> 03:07.920
Because what he did
is what I wanted to do too.

03:12.840 --> 03:14.520
- Come with me.
- You shouldn't be here.

03:14.600 --> 03:15.520
Why?

03:16.880 --> 03:19.480
Because I wasn't supposed to find
you were in on it with the Celestial Lord,

03:19.560 --> 03:21.600
or discover you were
behind the palace lantern case,

03:21.680 --> 03:24.560
or use an investigation
to bring you to justice?

03:26.000 --> 03:27.400
You think you're clever, huh?

03:28.400 --> 03:29.240
Fine.

03:29.880 --> 03:31.840
Then tell me

03:31.920 --> 03:33.680
how you discovered I was behind it.

03:34.480 --> 03:37.880
At first, I thought
the killer hid near the lantern

03:37.960 --> 03:39.840
and cut the cord when no one watched.

03:40.440 --> 03:41.880
But I missed one thing.

03:41.960 --> 03:43.680
The room was lit up everywhere.

03:43.760 --> 03:45.200
There was nowhere to hide.

03:45.800 --> 03:48.920
And around Lang Maochun,
there was only him alone.

03:49.440 --> 03:50.800
If it wasn't him,

03:51.400 --> 03:52.560
then only you could have cut it,

03:52.640 --> 03:54.160
as you were closest to him.

03:54.240 --> 03:55.360
I…

03:55.440 --> 03:56.440
I didn't do it.

03:56.520 --> 03:58.160
I didn't do it.

03:58.240 --> 03:59.320
Not me!

04:03.520 --> 04:05.480
Your Ladyship is decisive and bold.

04:05.560 --> 04:07.280
Like father, like daughter!

04:07.360 --> 04:08.800
But she's not like you.

04:09.400 --> 04:11.000
She didn't let Lang Maochun truly die.

04:11.920 --> 04:14.600
The one that was burned
was a corpse to begin with.

04:17.720 --> 04:19.760
I bet you hid a prepared body

04:19.839 --> 04:21.560
under the oilcloth-covered workbench.

04:26.080 --> 04:28.880
Using the flames and thick smoke as cover,

04:28.960 --> 04:30.480
Lang Maochun moved it out fast…

04:36.680 --> 04:38.760
making it look like
he'd been pierced by bamboo ribs.

04:38.840 --> 04:41.600
The build of that body

04:41.680 --> 04:44.960
and those bamboo wounds
were convincing enough.

04:45.040 --> 04:47.040
But you couldn't control one surprise.

04:47.680 --> 04:49.760
The paste under the dragon's eyes

04:50.280 --> 04:51.160
is this one.

04:53.840 --> 04:56.840
Lang Maochun's right fingers
were smeared with flammable oil.

04:57.440 --> 04:59.920
In the fire, they should've
been badly burned.

05:00.000 --> 05:02.040
Yet that corpse's fingers weren't.

05:02.120 --> 05:04.400
I had Physician Zhao examine it.

05:04.480 --> 05:08.360
That body had been dead for days
before it was burned.

05:08.960 --> 05:11.000
Your casework has improved.

05:11.520 --> 05:12.560
I made one mistake.

05:13.280 --> 05:16.120
Next is how you helped Lang Maochun flee.

05:16.200 --> 05:19.520
You must have had someone
pour out the tung oil in advance,

05:19.600 --> 05:21.400
allowing him to hide inside the barrel.

05:25.920 --> 05:26.880
What's in that barrel?

05:28.040 --> 05:29.000
Tung oil!

05:29.880 --> 05:30.960
Hurry!

05:36.240 --> 05:37.280
Move!

05:46.520 --> 05:47.960
And right then,

05:48.640 --> 05:50.680
the night-soil collector
you planted showed up.

06:00.720 --> 06:02.080
Who is it?

06:18.600 --> 06:19.440
Stop the cart!

06:24.160 --> 06:25.520
- Move!
- Got it.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.200
Your Ladyship.

06:30.280 --> 06:32.400
- Did you see anyone suspicious?
- No.

06:34.080 --> 06:35.600
- Search over there.
- Understood!

06:39.760 --> 06:40.600
You chased after him,

06:40.680 --> 06:42.640
not to catch the killer,

06:42.720 --> 06:44.720
but to escort Lang Maochun
out of the palace.

06:45.640 --> 06:46.800
Sharp as a needle.

06:47.320 --> 06:48.200
Good reasoning.

06:49.240 --> 06:51.520
But I don't have time
to chat with you here.

06:52.120 --> 06:54.440
In two hours, the Grand Festival begins.

06:54.960 --> 06:56.960
Uncle Luo and I still have a lot to do.

07:00.120 --> 07:01.160
Come back with me to see His Majesty.

07:01.920 --> 07:04.600
I go to the palace
to see His Majesty, of course.

07:04.680 --> 07:05.840
You know what I mean.

07:05.920 --> 07:07.560
And you know what I mean.

07:12.960 --> 07:14.560
I've already had this place surrounded.

07:14.640 --> 07:16.520
Even if you kill me,

07:17.040 --> 07:18.240
you won't make it out that gate.

07:19.840 --> 07:22.720
With our skills, no one can stop us.

07:22.800 --> 07:23.840
Your Ladyship.

07:23.920 --> 07:26.520
Last time, if not for him
playing generous at our expense,

07:26.600 --> 07:28.120
we would have had our revenge already!

07:35.560 --> 07:37.000
You know me.

07:37.560 --> 07:38.600
And I know you.

07:39.400 --> 07:41.600
You've always shown me mercy.

07:42.120 --> 07:42.960
You must come alone.

07:43.840 --> 07:46.200
If you only mean to stop me

07:46.280 --> 07:47.440
and won't walk with me,

07:48.200 --> 07:49.800
then I'll find someone else to walk with.

07:50.400 --> 07:51.520
And if I insist on stopping you?

07:51.600 --> 07:54.200
Then I can only step over you!

07:56.320 --> 07:59.440
A blood-feud like this
must be settled by my own hand.

08:03.600 --> 08:05.160
You're not a cold-blooded person.

08:05.960 --> 08:07.280
You and Consort Shu
are like mother and daughter.

08:07.960 --> 08:09.480
You can't bear to watch him take her life.

08:09.560 --> 08:11.360
They're only like mother and daughter!

08:11.880 --> 08:14.520
But Consort Shu and the Right Chancellor
are blood and bone.

08:14.600 --> 08:16.240
The Right Chancellor won't fall

08:16.320 --> 08:17.640
unless Consort Shu is removed!

08:21.960 --> 08:23.640
- Tie him up.
- Move!

08:40.360 --> 08:41.200
Do you regret it?

08:44.760 --> 08:45.640
I can't wait.

08:49.640 --> 08:52.240
XINGQING PALACE

08:52.320 --> 08:53.480
Stop the cart!

08:59.720 --> 09:00.840
FUCHANG COUNTY PRINCESS BADGE

09:03.280 --> 09:04.720
Who are you
from the County Princess's manor?

09:04.800 --> 09:06.200
Do you have a palace-issued pass?

09:07.120 --> 09:09.080
Even Her Ladyship's token
won't get me through?

09:09.160 --> 09:10.760
Security is tight today.

09:10.840 --> 09:13.360
Without a palace-issued pass,
you cannot enter.

09:13.440 --> 09:15.080
So I can't enter

09:15.160 --> 09:18.320
and let Her Ladyship go in herself
with the gifts for Consort Shu?

09:18.400 --> 09:19.600
You don't need to worry about that.

09:19.680 --> 09:21.120
The palace eunuchs will handle it.

09:22.880 --> 09:24.800
This face of mine
is worth less than a pass?

09:26.320 --> 09:27.200
Palace rules are palace rules.

09:29.000 --> 09:30.280
This brat doesn't know better.

09:30.360 --> 09:32.240
Your Ladyship, please forgive him.

09:32.320 --> 09:33.360
This way, please!

09:34.240 --> 09:35.560
We haven't searched the cart.

09:58.160 --> 09:59.280
Move it away.

10:11.080 --> 10:13.080
Boss, what's this?

10:13.880 --> 10:15.480
Put it down! We need to check it!

10:15.560 --> 10:17.360
This is my gift for Consort Shu.

10:17.440 --> 10:19.080
Let Her Highness open it herself.

10:20.760 --> 10:21.840
Understood.

10:23.680 --> 10:24.520
Your Ladyship,

10:24.600 --> 10:27.200
if you need anything, just give the word.

10:31.240 --> 10:32.840
You guys, go check over there.

10:32.920 --> 10:33.760
Understood!

10:38.280 --> 10:40.000
I know something will happen tonight.

10:40.080 --> 10:41.640
Inform me once you learn anything.

10:42.160 --> 10:43.080
I can help too.

10:45.920 --> 10:47.720
Then help check over there.

11:01.800 --> 11:05.800
Boss, Mr. Xiao said
the killer might strike again tonight.

11:06.560 --> 11:08.040
I've been on edge all day.

11:08.120 --> 11:09.880
Look, my hands are shaking.

11:17.440 --> 11:18.920
It's cold.

11:19.720 --> 11:20.880
You're dressed too lightly.

11:21.480 --> 11:22.600
Of course your hands are shaking.

11:23.320 --> 11:25.160
I'm on duty.

11:25.240 --> 11:26.520
You're making me embarrassed.

11:27.120 --> 11:28.040
Why be embarrassed?

11:28.560 --> 11:30.720
If you freeze,
you can't even wield your sword.

11:32.480 --> 11:34.520
Boss, you're really kind.

11:36.720 --> 11:37.640
Thank you.

11:38.160 --> 11:41.120
Tonight, I can't keep watch with you.

11:41.200 --> 11:43.320
With you beside
His Majesty and Consort Shu,

11:43.400 --> 11:44.480
I'll feel more at ease.

11:53.360 --> 11:55.920
He's in charge of the gifts
for His Majesty and Consort Shu.

11:56.000 --> 11:57.360
Treat him as you would treat me.

11:58.240 --> 11:59.280
Understood!

12:10.000 --> 12:11.880
Enjoy the night.

12:15.080 --> 12:15.920
ONE TRUE MASTER IS ENOUGH

12:16.520 --> 12:19.240
The Protector-General has sent troops
to station outside Chunming Gate.

12:19.320 --> 12:20.920
We're waiting for your order, Master.

12:29.840 --> 12:31.240
Has the evening drum sounded?

12:32.120 --> 12:33.600
It's the start of You Hour.

12:36.000 --> 12:37.040
Wait a little longer.

12:41.960 --> 12:43.760
Pass it on. Keep strict watch.

12:43.840 --> 12:45.000
Understood!

12:58.080 --> 12:58.920
Wuren.

13:00.120 --> 13:02.000
- How is it?
- No sign of anything.

13:13.760 --> 13:14.600
Go check over there.

13:23.640 --> 13:24.760
What time is it?

13:27.600 --> 13:29.000
The second ke of You Hour.

13:29.760 --> 13:30.600
Master,

13:31.200 --> 13:35.000
His Majesty will never summon you
for tonight's Grand Festival.

13:47.080 --> 13:48.120
You may go now.

13:49.080 --> 13:51.800
Master, we really can't wait any longer.

13:52.400 --> 13:54.400
The Imperial Guards
have doubled inside the palace.

13:54.480 --> 13:57.200
Consort Shu will be in danger
at the Grand Festival.

13:57.800 --> 14:00.360
Move now, or it'll be too late!

14:03.600 --> 14:05.360
We siblings

14:07.120 --> 14:08.640
have served His Majesty

14:09.560 --> 14:11.800
with all our hearts for decades.

14:12.720 --> 14:15.680
As long as His Majesty remembers
the bond we once had,

14:16.800 --> 14:18.960
I won't take it too far.

14:19.640 --> 14:23.120
Tonight, if I lead troops into the palace,

14:23.200 --> 14:27.480
whether to purge the traitors
or to save Consort Shu,

14:27.560 --> 14:29.760
in His Majesty's eyes,

14:29.840 --> 14:31.440
it would be treason.

14:37.840 --> 14:38.800
So…

14:40.720 --> 14:41.680
let's wait a little longer.

14:48.720 --> 14:49.600
A guest is here.

14:57.720 --> 14:59.320
Chen Luo has entered
the palace with Her Ladyship.

14:59.400 --> 15:00.880
Everything is in place.

15:01.600 --> 15:03.720
And the Right Chancellor
is about to boil over.

15:05.960 --> 15:07.360
Everything is ready.

15:07.880 --> 15:08.920
And the time has come.

15:10.200 --> 15:11.880
- Let's enter the palace.
- Understood!

16:10.720 --> 16:12.000
XINGQING PALACE

16:12.080 --> 16:12.920
Stop right there!

16:13.000 --> 16:14.240
Deputy Director Xiao.

16:16.640 --> 16:20.200
Consort Shu is about to dance!

17:21.280 --> 17:26.200
CHUNMING GATE

17:32.240 --> 17:33.080
Mr. Xiao?

17:33.160 --> 17:34.040
Why are you here so late?

17:34.120 --> 17:36.080
- Have you seen Chen Luo?
- Chen Luo?

17:36.160 --> 17:38.360
He's the Celestial Lord.
He should be in the palace right now.

18:15.720 --> 18:17.440
Why are the fireworks lit at this time?

18:17.520 --> 18:18.720
They must have made a mistake.

18:21.880 --> 18:23.000
"Phoenix Dances Across the Nine Heavens.

18:23.080 --> 18:24.840
Venus Shines in Tandem."

18:25.360 --> 18:26.560
What's that supposed to mean?

18:28.240 --> 18:29.160
Your Majesty,

18:29.240 --> 18:32.520
it was supposed to be
"Dragon Roams the Four Seas."

18:32.600 --> 18:33.440
How could it…

18:34.200 --> 18:36.560
Why are you still standing there?
Go check it now!

18:36.640 --> 18:38.520
- Go, now!
- Understood.

19:07.080 --> 19:08.240
"Phoenix Dances Across the Nine Heavens."

19:09.200 --> 19:11.200
In the whole sky, only one phoenix reigns.

19:12.000 --> 19:13.080
Mr. Xiao?

19:13.160 --> 19:14.120
They're using

19:14.640 --> 19:16.840
the Grand Festival fireworks
to brand Consort Shu as one

19:16.920 --> 19:17.760
who'd upend the realm.

19:19.000 --> 19:21.960
They're using His Majesty's hand
to have her executed.

19:23.880 --> 19:25.560
Whoever set up
those fireworks deserves death.

19:25.640 --> 19:26.840
I'll go check it.

19:27.640 --> 19:28.560
It's Her Ladyship.

19:29.640 --> 19:31.120
Her Ladyship prepared the fireworks.

19:31.760 --> 19:33.600
And there was someone with her.

19:33.680 --> 19:35.360
I thought he was just a servant.

19:35.960 --> 19:37.680
It's all my fault. I let my guard down.

19:38.560 --> 19:39.640
Her Ladyship?

19:40.160 --> 19:41.080
Why would she do this?

19:42.760 --> 19:45.000
- She wants Consort Shu dead?
- Let's go!

19:52.080 --> 19:53.600
So that's it.

19:59.160 --> 20:00.760
At tonight's Grand Festival,

20:00.840 --> 20:02.200
the Cui clan faces a great disaster.

20:09.080 --> 20:10.880
CHUNMING GATE

20:14.920 --> 20:16.160
How is it in the palace?

20:16.920 --> 20:18.920
His Majesty is furious.
He may order Consort Shu executed.

20:24.560 --> 20:25.400
Report!

20:25.480 --> 20:26.720
No idea how the news got out,

20:26.800 --> 20:28.960
but a squad of Imperial Guards
is heading this way!

20:31.840 --> 20:33.920
You can put Consort Shu on a pedestal,

20:34.520 --> 20:36.360
but you can never bring her down.

20:36.960 --> 20:38.560
Trying to use this

20:39.080 --> 20:42.080
to frame her as a traitor

20:42.160 --> 20:44.280
and wipe out my clan?

20:45.280 --> 20:47.520
Wrong move!

20:49.760 --> 20:51.480
His Majesty is blind.

20:53.080 --> 20:55.640
He won't even give me a chance to explain

20:56.360 --> 20:58.920
and already wants me wiped out!

21:00.080 --> 21:00.920
Fine.

21:01.600 --> 21:04.800
Since you drive me to rebel,
I have no choice!

21:06.200 --> 21:07.800
I'll give you what you want.

21:08.400 --> 21:09.880
I'll oblige you.

21:12.240 --> 21:13.560
Kill!

21:13.640 --> 21:14.680
Kill!

21:18.000 --> 21:19.200
CHUNMING GATE

21:24.120 --> 21:25.480
TANG

21:38.080 --> 21:39.200
Cui Minzhong!

21:39.800 --> 21:42.960
You dare raise troops at the palace gates!

21:43.040 --> 21:46.200
Today, for His Majesty,

21:46.800 --> 21:47.880
I'll wipe out you rebels!

21:49.360 --> 21:50.880
Who do you think you are?

21:51.480 --> 21:53.320
You framed me first,

21:53.840 --> 21:55.480
then claim you're quelling rebels.

21:55.560 --> 21:57.600
You're the real villain here.

21:57.680 --> 21:59.760
I may not be a general,

22:00.760 --> 22:04.400
but I'll still fight
for this loyal heart of mine!

22:04.480 --> 22:06.000
- Kill!
- Kill!

22:35.840 --> 22:36.920
Send word back to the palace.

22:37.440 --> 22:38.720
The Right Chancellor has rebelled!

22:38.800 --> 22:39.640
Understood!

22:46.200 --> 22:47.320
It's done.

22:47.400 --> 22:48.440
Once the sign goes up,

22:48.520 --> 22:50.640
Consort Shu is as good as dead!

22:51.240 --> 22:53.120
The Cui clan is finished!

22:56.320 --> 22:57.640
Congrats, Commandant Chen.

22:57.720 --> 22:59.480
Your vengeance is complete.

23:00.440 --> 23:01.600
Congrats, My Lord!

23:09.320 --> 23:11.520
Anyone who tries to stop me dies!

23:12.040 --> 23:13.160
Open the gate!

23:24.960 --> 23:26.440
His Majesty has an edict.

23:26.520 --> 23:28.320
One more step,

23:29.120 --> 23:30.640
and you walk to your death!

23:55.280 --> 23:56.680
This is…

23:57.320 --> 23:58.680
Her Ladyship didn't kill Consort Shu?

24:03.600 --> 24:06.000
Your Majesty, look!

24:06.080 --> 24:09.800
"Phoenix Blesses a Thousand Generations.

24:09.880 --> 24:13.080
Dragon Soars to the Highest Heaven!"

24:13.160 --> 24:15.760
A dragon and a phoenix in harmony.

24:15.840 --> 24:21.120
May Great Tang prosper
for endless generations!

24:21.200 --> 24:22.080
LI QIANG, CROWN PRINCE

24:47.400 --> 24:48.800
So that's it…

24:53.960 --> 24:56.000
So that's it.

24:56.080 --> 24:58.440
This whole puzzle

24:58.520 --> 25:01.760
was to force me to raise troops.

25:03.560 --> 25:06.080
What a fine scheme.

25:06.800 --> 25:07.680
Xie Binglin.

25:08.200 --> 25:09.080
Where are you?

25:11.000 --> 25:12.240
Master!

25:16.440 --> 25:17.800
Turn back while you can.

25:17.880 --> 25:20.520
There may still be a way out!

25:22.720 --> 25:25.040
Trying to make me surrender?

25:26.280 --> 25:27.760
You think you're worthy?

25:34.720 --> 25:36.840
I have no way back now.

25:36.920 --> 25:37.880
Kill them!

25:37.960 --> 25:38.920
Fire!

25:44.520 --> 25:47.120
Kill!

26:38.560 --> 26:40.520
I want to see His Majesty.

26:41.040 --> 26:42.840
I want to see Consort Shu!

26:46.880 --> 26:50.360
Today, even if I die,

26:51.000 --> 26:54.000
I won't die at the hands

26:54.960 --> 26:56.960
of you ants!

27:19.440 --> 27:20.520
The palace has been unsettled of late,

27:21.320 --> 27:24.520
and that nursery rhyme
going around in the capital

27:24.600 --> 27:26.160
bears sinister intent.

27:26.240 --> 27:28.080
I saw enemies in every shadow.

27:28.680 --> 27:30.360
I nearly took it out on you.

27:30.440 --> 27:32.960
Please, don't blame me.

27:34.000 --> 27:36.000
I understand Your Majesty's heart.

27:36.800 --> 27:38.680
How could I blame Your Majesty?

27:45.320 --> 27:46.280
Your Majesty.

27:47.440 --> 27:49.840
The Right Chancellor
led troops and forced the gate.

27:49.920 --> 27:51.080
He awaits your judgment.

27:53.240 --> 27:54.200
Let him in.

28:02.800 --> 28:03.720
Your Majesty.

28:03.800 --> 28:05.480
Cui Minzhong colluded with rebel forces

28:05.560 --> 28:06.640
and charged the palace gate.

28:06.720 --> 28:08.000
He committed treason,

28:08.080 --> 28:09.200
seeking to overthrow the realm.

28:09.280 --> 28:11.480
Now, the rebel has been seized,

28:11.560 --> 28:13.600
and his accomplices
have all been captured.

28:16.240 --> 28:17.360
Let go of me!

28:35.600 --> 28:36.480
Your Majesty,

28:37.840 --> 28:39.720
this humble minister can finally

28:40.640 --> 28:42.200
see your face again.

28:43.800 --> 28:45.000
Cui Minzhong,

28:45.640 --> 28:47.320
you've grown bold, huh?

28:53.400 --> 28:54.280
Your Majesty,

28:55.040 --> 28:56.080
I'm wronged.

28:58.000 --> 28:59.240
Look at you.

28:59.760 --> 29:01.080
The evidence is solid,

29:01.160 --> 29:02.440
and you still want to argue?

29:03.440 --> 29:05.160
I obeyed your command,

29:05.680 --> 29:07.920
copied scriptures at home to repent,

29:08.520 --> 29:10.520
and never dared cross the line.

29:11.840 --> 29:15.360
But someone wouldn't let me go.

29:15.440 --> 29:17.280
They wanted me dead!

29:17.360 --> 29:19.120
I'm not afraid to die.

29:19.800 --> 29:22.840
I'm afraid someone used
a nursery rhyme to spread rumors,

29:22.920 --> 29:24.560
using Consort Shu

29:25.080 --> 29:26.280
to sow discord.

29:26.360 --> 29:30.920
They wanted Your Majesty
to suspect this loyal minister!

29:31.520 --> 29:33.040
I only doubted you,

29:33.120 --> 29:34.480
and you wanted to kill me?

29:35.000 --> 29:39.320
Cui Minzhong, so loyal, aren't you?

29:39.400 --> 29:44.320
My blade cut down
what blocked my road to see Your Majesty.

29:44.400 --> 29:46.040
It severed

29:47.080 --> 29:49.480
your misunderstanding of me.

29:50.360 --> 29:52.360
It's true I brought troops
into the palace.

29:52.440 --> 29:53.560
But only this way

29:53.640 --> 29:57.320
could I make Your Majesty
see my sincere heart!

29:58.040 --> 30:00.240
This minister was forced into it.

30:00.320 --> 30:01.840
I had no choice.

30:02.840 --> 30:04.720
The one who set this up

30:06.400 --> 30:09.200
truly means harm to Great Tang.

30:09.280 --> 30:11.320
They deserve death!

30:11.960 --> 30:13.560
You raised the troops,

30:13.640 --> 30:16.360
and you got yourself covered in blood.

30:16.440 --> 30:17.720
And you still

30:18.240 --> 30:20.680
want to pin this crime
on someone who doesn't exist?

30:22.680 --> 30:23.640
At first,

30:24.600 --> 30:25.880
I couldn't understand

30:26.520 --> 30:28.760
how someone could be so vicious,

30:28.840 --> 30:31.680
hate this minister to such a degree.

30:32.200 --> 30:33.560
But today…

30:36.520 --> 30:38.240
I finally understand.

30:39.120 --> 30:40.920
The one behind it

30:41.000 --> 30:42.880
has a name.

30:43.800 --> 30:46.440
She is Li Peiyi!

31:00.480 --> 31:01.760
Cui Minzhong,

31:02.360 --> 31:05.360
was tonight's Grand Festival
to your liking?

31:06.840 --> 31:08.960
Your Majesty. You saw it.

31:09.680 --> 31:10.840
It was her.

31:10.920 --> 31:13.400
That cursed lone star is dissatisfied
with Your Majesty's punishment of me

31:13.480 --> 31:15.440
and wants me dead!

31:15.520 --> 31:17.360
She not only drove a wedge between us,

31:17.440 --> 31:19.680
she also used my love for Consort Shu

31:19.760 --> 31:23.560
to make me think
Your Majesty meant to kill her!

31:23.640 --> 31:24.640
Don't smear her!

31:32.040 --> 31:32.920
Your Majesty.

31:34.360 --> 31:36.920
The culprit behind the palace murders
has been identified.

31:37.000 --> 31:38.760
We're just waiting
to catch him red-handed.

31:38.840 --> 31:40.200
It has nothing to do with Her Ladyship.

31:41.440 --> 31:42.640
Silence!

31:45.360 --> 31:49.320
You and Li Peiyi are in league.

31:50.120 --> 31:53.080
You had a hand in framing me!

31:53.160 --> 31:54.800
How dare you vouch for her?

31:57.560 --> 31:58.800
You've always had a silver tongue.

31:59.800 --> 32:01.080
Now the evidence is ironclad.

32:01.160 --> 32:04.480
So I'm curious
how you will twist the truth.

32:05.160 --> 32:08.200
This woman has plotted
against me at every turn.

32:08.800 --> 32:09.720
Your Majesty,

32:09.800 --> 32:11.680
the recent murders in the palace

32:11.760 --> 32:14.560
and that nursery rhyme
spreading through the capital

32:14.640 --> 32:16.680
must be all her doing!

32:18.720 --> 32:20.040
If I hadn't gone this far,

32:21.240 --> 32:23.360
how could I see Your Majesty again

32:25.720 --> 32:27.200
and see my little sister again?

32:30.160 --> 32:31.000
Little sister.

32:31.520 --> 32:33.160
Consort Shu.

32:33.240 --> 32:36.000
You know me!

32:36.080 --> 32:39.600
When have I ever been disloyal

32:40.280 --> 32:42.960
to Your Majesty or to Tang?

32:48.200 --> 32:49.080
My beloved,

32:50.200 --> 32:52.440
in your opinion, what should we do?

33:05.520 --> 33:08.120
Cui Minzhong has committed treason.

33:08.200 --> 33:10.240
This is a minister's greatest crime.

33:10.960 --> 33:13.560
As the sister of a traitor,

33:13.640 --> 33:16.600
I'm willing to accept
the punishment with him,

33:17.400 --> 33:18.480
without complaint or regret.

33:27.240 --> 33:28.600
My beloved, please rise.

33:39.400 --> 33:42.440
Get back to your manor and await judgment!

33:45.000 --> 33:46.040
Your Majesty…

33:46.720 --> 33:47.760
Your Majesty!

33:56.160 --> 33:57.320
I told you.

33:57.960 --> 33:59.000
You won't escape.

34:12.080 --> 34:13.280
Your Majesty…

34:14.000 --> 34:14.840
Your Majesty!

34:15.360 --> 34:17.040
I'm wronged!

34:17.120 --> 34:18.040
Your Majesty!

34:18.639 --> 34:19.679
I…

34:20.480 --> 34:21.560
I'm wronged…

34:24.239 --> 34:26.000
Consort Shu didn't die,

34:26.080 --> 34:28.560
but Cui Minzhong
did lead troops into the palace.

34:28.639 --> 34:30.760
He can't escape the charge of treason now.

34:30.840 --> 34:32.199
He'll never rise again.

34:32.280 --> 34:35.440
Your plan has been achieved.

34:37.320 --> 34:40.199
Cui Minzhong was just a street thug.

34:40.280 --> 34:42.400
How did he reach
the rank of Right Chancellor

34:42.480 --> 34:44.360
and keep His Majesty's favor
for over ten years?

34:44.440 --> 34:45.280
Who backed him?

34:47.600 --> 34:49.159
Bring down one Cui Minzhong,

34:49.239 --> 34:51.280
and there'll always be another.

34:52.000 --> 34:54.679
The Prince of Duan's death
doesn't count against her?

34:56.440 --> 34:58.760
It was my failure.
One lapse in a meticulous plan.

34:58.840 --> 35:00.360
I didn't foresee

35:00.440 --> 35:04.240
that Her Ladyship still valued
Consort Shu's motherly care.

35:04.840 --> 35:07.720
She must have tampered with the fireworks.

35:07.800 --> 35:09.480
It wasn't just about the fireworks.

35:10.080 --> 35:11.920
We all underestimated Li Peiyi.

35:12.000 --> 35:14.640
She'd been using us from the start.

35:14.720 --> 35:17.120
Go clean up what you should.

35:18.480 --> 35:19.560
Understood.

36:08.840 --> 36:09.720
You…

36:16.600 --> 36:18.360
You betrayed the Prince of Duan,

36:18.880 --> 36:20.480
and now you set me up too.

36:21.000 --> 36:23.240
You're unworthy of being his daughter!

36:25.040 --> 36:28.840
Your insults are as ridiculous
as your grand speeches.

36:29.440 --> 36:32.160
From the very moment my mother bore me,

36:32.240 --> 36:34.160
I was the Prince of Duan's daughter.

36:34.240 --> 36:35.760
Whatever kind of person I am,

36:35.840 --> 36:37.800
that's what
the Prince of Duan's daughter is.

36:37.880 --> 36:39.120
You don't get to judge.

36:39.720 --> 36:43.200
Today, I'll clean out
the traitor for the Prince of Duan!
